  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Limitless — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, your control over blue and space has increased. As an action, you can teleport yourself or another willing creature you touch 10 ft per Cursed Energy used.<br />\n You can teleport an additional creature by doubling the cursed energy cost. Additionally, with the use of a binding vow, you can instead teleport a creature to a 5 ft circle you have prepared. You can teleport a willing creature you touch to one of these circles as an action for 5 cursed energy. You can only have one circle per binding vow.  </p>",
